{
  "id": "tokstat",
  "name": {
    "default": "AI Token Usage",
    "zh": "AI 用量",
    "ja": "AI トークン使用量"
  },
  "description": {
    "default": "AI coding token usage (session & weekly) in your menu bar — progress bars, reset countdowns. Enable the providers you use; pick which show in the menu bar.",
    "zh": "在菜单栏查看 AI 编程用量（会话与每周），含进度条与重置倒计时。按需启用各家、选择在菜单栏显示哪些。",
    "ja": "メニューバーで AI コーディングの使用量（セッション・週）を表示。使うプロバイダを有効化し、メニューバーに出すものを選べます。"
  },
  "version": "0.3.0",
  "license": "MIT",
  "min_runtime": "0.1.2",
  "renderer": "auto",
  "requires": [
    {
      "plugin": "aicreds",
      "version": ">=0.1.0"
    }
  ],
  "permissions": [
    "data:read",
    "data:write",
    "settings:read",
    "settings:write"
  ],
  "settings": {
    "groups": [
      {
        "title": { "default": "Track", "zh": "统计", "ja": "計測" },
        "fields": [
          {
            "key": "enable_claude",
            "type": "bool",
            "default": "true",
            "label": { "default": "Claude", "zh": "Claude", "ja": "Claude" },
            "help": { "default": "Poll Claude usage and show it in the popover", "zh": "定时获取 Claude 用量并在弹层显示", "ja": "Claude の使用量を取得しポップオーバーに表示" }
          },
          {
            "key": "enable_codex",
            "type": "bool",
            "default": "true",
            "label": { "default": "Codex", "zh": "Codex", "ja": "Codex" },
            "help": { "default": "Poll Codex usage and show it in the popover", "zh": "定时获取 Codex 用量并在弹层显示", "ja": "Codex の使用量を取得しポップオーバーに表示" }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": { "default": "Menu bar", "zh": "菜单栏", "ja": "メニューバー" },
        "fields": [
          {
            "key": "menubar_layout",
            "type": "select",
            "default": "horizontal",
            "label": { "default": "Layout", "zh": "排列", "ja": "レイアウト" },
            "options": [
              { "value": "horizontal", "label": { "default": "Horizontal", "zh": "水平", "ja": "横" } },
              { "value": "vertical", "label": { "default": "Vertical", "zh": "竖直", "ja": "縦" } }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "tray_claude",
            "type": "bool",
            "default": "true",
            "label": { "default": "Claude", "zh": "Claude", "ja": "Claude" },
            "help": { "default": "Show Claude in the menu bar (up to 2)", "zh": "在菜单栏显示 Claude（最多 2 个）", "ja": "メニューバーに Claude を表示（最大 2 件）" },
            "disabledWhen": { "key": "enable_claude", "equals": "false" }
          },
          {
            "key": "tray_codex",
            "type": "bool",
            "default": "true",
            "label": { "default": "Codex", "zh": "Codex", "ja": "Codex" },
            "help": { "default": "Show Codex in the menu bar (up to 2)", "zh": "在菜单栏显示 Codex（最多 2 个）", "ja": "メニューバーに Codex を表示（最大 2 件）" },
            "disabledWhen": { "key": "enable_codex", "equals": "false" }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "collections": {
    "samples": {
      "storage": "persistent",
      "schema": {
        "ts": { "type": "integer" },
        "source": { "type": "string" },
        "ok": { "type": "boolean" },
        "session_pct": { "type": "integer" },
        "weekly_pct": { "type": "integer" },
        "session_resets_ms": { "type": "integer" },
        "weekly_resets_ms": { "type": "integer" }
      }
    },
    "current": {
      "storage": "persistent",
      "schema": {
        "source": { "type": "string" },
        "label": { "type": "string" },
        "abbrev": { "type": "string" },
        "order": { "type": "integer" },
        "enabled": { "type": "boolean" },
        "ts": { "type": "integer" },
        "ok": { "type": "boolean" },
        "needs_auth": { "type": "boolean" },
        "err": { "type": "string" },
        "session_pct": { "type": "integer" },
        "session_pct_text": { "type": "string" },
        "session_color": { "type": "string" },
        "session_reset_text": { "type": "string" },
        "weekly_pct": { "type": "integer" },
        "weekly_pct_text": { "type": "string" },
        "weekly_color": { "type": "string" },
        "weekly_reset_text": { "type": "string" }
      }
    }
  },
  "jobs": [
    {
      "id": "refresh",
      "run": "refresh",
      "every": 300000,
      "while": "always"
    }
  ],
  "comment_state": "DATA_FLOW.md：refresh job(每 5min + 开窗即刷/切设置即刷)对每个已启用 provider 读凭据(aicreds)→ app 内 HTTP 拉用量 → upsert `current`(每 provider 一行,by_field source,含 enabled 标志) + append `samples`。`current` 是**持久缓存**:禁用只标 enabled=false(不删,保值);429/需登录 → 保留上次真值,current 缺失但有 sample → 从最新 sample 重建。弹层 <DataList collection=current where enabled=true orderBy order> 数据驱动渲染;菜单栏 TrayLabel 用 <Image logo>+<Progress bar> 读 `current`,可见性靠 ui.tsx 守卫 `enable_X && tray_X`(op:if),方向靠 `menubar_layout` 设置。settings 两组:统计(enable_X 总开关)/ 菜单栏(menubar_layout + tray_X,tray_X disabledWhen enable_X=false 置灰)。加新 provider(gemini…)=改 scripts PROVIDERS + aicreds + settings 两组各加开关 + ui.tsx 加一组 logo/bar 与弹层块。不用 setState 表征(全走 SQLite,walker 可读)。",
  "state": {},
  "window": {
    "width": 280,
    "height": 340
  }
}
